1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Abraham Aberle SCHIFF: b. ? - d. 2 June 1715, Frankfurt am Main
2 CONT
2 CONT Valuable details gleaned courtesy of the following website:
2 CONT
2 CONT DigiBaeck Search Results | Leo Baeck Institute
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.lbi.org/digibaeck/results/?qtype=pid&term=258967
2 CONT
2 CONT Ele Toldot ([Burial records of the Jewish community of Frankfurt am Main]), 1241-1824
2 CONT
2 CONT Abraham, "husband of Reizchen" ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Aberle Sif (sic) died 02.06.1715 and was buried next to Lejzer Josef Jehuda and his brother Bendit Sif.
2 CONT
2 CONT House: Goldstein
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Mose SCHIFF z. Goldstein (d. 29.11.1672), son of Jakef KATZ
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Frajdhen (d. 21.12.169?), daughter of Dewle SCHEUER
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Gelhen (d. 19.05.1690), daughter of Kalman STRAUSS
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) circa 1691 to the widow of Zalman: Rajtshen (d. 28.07.1696), daughter of Smul ESSEN
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Bendit SCHIFF z. Goldstein, d. ? 08.04.1766
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) Dowid, d. 10.04.1693, unmarried
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Melhen (d. 06.04.1736), m. Wolf OPPENHEIM z. weissen Löwen
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Ester (d. 21.01.1742), m. Wolf OPPENHEIM z. weissen Löwen
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) ? (?d. 12.07.1733), m. Lejb BRILLIN-NAS
2 CONT
2 CONT Various notes especially about daughter ? m. BRILLIN-NAS
2 CONT
2 CONT And also ...
2 CONT
2 CONT cf. Information on father-in-law Kalman STRAUSS z. Knoblauch ...
