1 OCCU moved to Cleve in 1660, to become partner in Banking House with his uncles Joseph Elias and Lehman Gomperts., Rabbi in Kleve, Banker in Kleve
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} né en 1656?
2 CONT
2 CONT Juda Löb et Jacob son beau-frère, frère de Bella, fondent la banque "Gomperz frères" à Clèves
2 CONT
2 CONT "Die Familie Wolf" - by Ernst Wolf 1924 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.fpe.ch/stammbaum/ see pg. 118 
2 CONT
2 CONT see also chart Lion Gomperz. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Die Inschriften des Alten Judenfriedhofes in Wien" Band II- by Dr. Bernhard Wachstein- pg. 272 note 1
