1 NOTE Salomon Halphen, Joaillier à Paris, beau-frère de Jacob Lazard, articles
2 CONT nécrologiques pour tous les deux dans les Archives Israélites de France .
2 CONT Salomon Halphen est fils de
2 CONT Marc Abraham Halphen
2 CONT et Rachel Gompertz, elle même descendante de Gluckel Hameln.
2 CONT A ma connaissance, Salomon Halphen a eu sept fils et un fille, Caroline
2 CONT halphen Javal.
2 CONT
2 CONT Philippe Danan
2 CONT Ph.D [mimibob@wanadoo.fr]
2 CONT
2 CONT Salomon Halphen, born 1773 Metz, died  July 10, 1840 Paris, was married
2 CONT > to  Malka CAHEN d'Augny, born  September 21, 1778 Metz, died 1864 Paris,
2 CONT > Seine?.
2 CONT > His descendants were (under many others) the LADENBURG, Merton, de
2 CONT > GUNZBURG, Pereire, DEUTSCH de la MEURTHE, de ROTHSCHILD.
2 CONT >
2 CONT > I'd like to learn about his parents
2 CONT >
2 CONT > Christof Eberstadt
