1 NAME Judah Löw /de Symons/
2 GIVN Judah Löw
2 SURN de Symons
2 _MARNM Pressburg
1 NAME Baron Lyon de Symons
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1741
2 PLAC Bratislava, Slovakia
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1814
2 PLAC London, England
2 ADDR
1 TITL Baron
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Diamond merchant
2 CONT
2 CONT The Western Synagogue in London owes its origin to Wolf Liebman of St. Petersburg and his nephew Baron Lyon de Symons, who resided in Bedford-row and cooperated about the year 1768 in the establishment of a Minyan, which met in th
2 CONC e private house of Liebman for nearly thirty years.  In 1797 a regular congregation was established -- the first Synagogue in the West-End of London.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father is Shmuel in birth records of his children.  See https://web.archive.org/web/20050508075955/http://www.eclipse.co.uk/exeshul/susser/gsbirths/gsbirthsfour.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=YoQpAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA258&dq=lyon+de+symons&lr=&ei=KDxrSp7dOYnSlAS3-71L&client=safari
2 CONT
2 CONT Many disputes with Nathan Mayer Rothschild
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=khxKMg6wjH4C&pg=PA5&dq=lyon+de+symons&ei=gTtrSqXyIJqGkgSireVn&client=safari
2 CONT
2 CONT Involved in DuBarry affair. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://books.google.com/books?id=9HVNxoDIP88C&pg=PA158&dq=lyon+de+symons&ei=QDtrSorNI4nSlAS3-71L&client=safari
2 CONT
2 CONT Cox v. Parry (1786) (insurance on jewels) http://books.google.com/books?id=RuYvAAAAIAAJ&pg=PA464&dq=law+cases+lyon++symons&hl=en&sa=X&ei=JjHJT-C_Gcis2gWF5ZnaCw&ved=0CLYBEOgBMBA#v=onepage&q=law%20cases%20lyon%20%20symons&f=false
2 CONT
2 CONT For proof that his father is Samuel and not Simon,  See the birth records for his children. https://web.archive.org/web/20050508075955/http://www.eclipse.co.uk/exeshul/susser/gsbirths/gsbirthsfour.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTHS
2 CONT
